head('8. Task and approval-state rules')
para('Track work stage separately from head approval, Marketing approval and external client approval. Recommended canonical work stages: Not started, In progress, Review pending, Revision required, Internally finalized, Awaiting client approval, Client approved, Scheduled, Published, Completed, Blocked/on hold, Cancelled. These normalized names are a proposal; do not rewrite historical workbook meaning without a mapping decision.')
para('Minimum recommended task record: unique task ID; account/project; task/brief; accountable holder; priority; due/start/end dates; dependencies/inputs; deliverable link; relevant reviewer; quality decision; Marketing decision; presentation/version reference; client decision; comments with author/date; owner response and review outcome; final archive/live link. Additional columns are proposed controls, not claims about existing workbook structure.')
head('9. Exceptions and continuity')
